  "content": {
    "prompt": "Complete the multiply method in the MyMethods class so that it returns the product of the non-negative integer n multipled by the integer m. Use recursion and addition. Do not use multiplication!",
    "source_code": "public class MyMethods\n{  \n   public static int multiply(int n, int m)\n   {   \n      if (n == 0)\n        return ...;\n\n      int simplerResult = multiply(n - 1, m);\n      \n      // your work goes here\n   }\n\n}"
